    "Did you ever use AI to support your math learning in the last year? If yes, how was your experience?": "Not directly, but I’ve explored chatbots like Mathway for quick checks when stuck on algebra or formulas. It was helpful for verifying work, though I still prefer working out problems myself to build understanding. The system sometimes gave unclear answers—like my openness score suggests I seek diverse perspectives.",
